  context:\nWestJet Group Inc. (WJACN) is bringing a $500 million Senior Se
 cured Notes offering via Barclays as Lead Left\, with joint bookrunners in
 cluding MS\, RBC\, BMO\, Scotia\, GS\, TD\, CIBC\, ATB\, NatBank\, and CIT
 I. The deal is rated B1/B- (Moody's/Fitch) — notably no S&P rating as this
